[{:db/id "q-4334/selection/044a6502a46791c125b3ddc852a3129316e9b90d0c6ab586be4dd1293baf3d10" :answer/id #uuid "326eebcc-b0f2-5bf2-88dc-9ec60b2be90d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-4334/selection/b78a9f4afb5b220698558b523c0b6bde5306ac4caf930f748ce2e56e25e342d2" :answer/id #uuid "b5097416-7af7-5a21-82ea-2446a38a6144" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-4334/selection/d002b9d3cbc949dd5ec1f7fb1bfc69ace6047b5950640feff3f5e459c0dc5982" :answer/id #uuid "89679bbb-9899-513f-b0e5-445a07d1397d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\,\\text{arcsin}(\\frac{x}{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-4334/selection/266051b0624da0f699896b0e7e6779775045eeea33c2d33ec835cd678c18bfc0" :answer/id #uuid "ace5875f-c272-5c12-b5f2-800ec6d1b51e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-4334/selection/943db70acae8b9739a30bd8a69c1efd304133121250f557933a167abd89d3c23" :answer/id #uuid "b8a99452-c547-5a17-a7dc-0476f3c8766e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{arcsec}(\\frac{x}{2})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-4334/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7c1d72d6-d589-5f95-a4dd-1daa476812b7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-4334/selection/044a6502a46791c125b3ddc852a3129316e9b90d0c6ab586be4dd1293baf3d10" :answer-field/choices ["q-4334/selection/044a6502a46791c125b3ddc852a3129316e9b90d0c6ab586be4dd1293baf3d10" "q-4334/selection/b78a9f4afb5b220698558b523c0b6bde5306ac4caf930f748ce2e56e25e342d2" "q-4334/selection/d002b9d3cbc949dd5ec1f7fb1bfc69ace6047b5950640feff3f5e459c0dc5982" "q-4334/selection/266051b0624da0f699896b0e7e6779775045eeea33c2d33ec835cd678c18bfc0" "q-4334/selection/943db70acae8b9739a30bd8a69c1efd304133121250f557933a167abd89d3c23"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-4334" :question/id #uuid "f9c1b2a7-f940-503a-9ad4-f61f8fa31b38" :question/math-academy-id "q-4334" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{36-{x}^{2}}}\\text{d}x\\,=$" :question/worked-solution "Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{36-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{36\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/36)}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/36}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/6)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${(\\frac{x}{6})}^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\frac{x}{6}.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{6}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=6\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{36-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{6}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/6)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot (6\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-4334/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "de1e3f3a-5a64-573f-8fb1-9952fa36a839"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-4334"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-49547"] :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{49-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{49-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =3\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{49\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/49)}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/49}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/7)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${(\\frac{x}{7})}^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\frac{x}{7}.$ Differentiating, we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{7}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=7\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{49-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{3}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/7)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot (7\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =3\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{x}{7})+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-49540"] :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{6}{1+9{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse tangent,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $9{x}^{2}=(3x)^{2}.$\n\nSo. let's substitute $u=3x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{6}{1+9{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =6\\int \\frac{1}{1+(3x)^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =6\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =2\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(3x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-73714/selection/e45b5286f7dee8d041565f116f02c257e589352ef66d7090844001e37aaae6e4" :answer/id #uuid "b413e93d-3ea1-5565-ab88-37ce7a34aff1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73714/selection/7b9970927b2dd83c5fa0f72f661c572075f63de1d1b70be88b465e9c8160fc6d" :answer/id #uuid "5ced324b-5e0c-5279-8fcb-1672a0195c12" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73714/selection/d59716c54325f060c210c240d10da8050c8d98b14dad7a953b28c5f1cf292fd8" :answer/id #uuid "0d5e154d-38e9-56ca-b0a6-e00f00525f23" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(6x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73714/selection/f1da6d3489b34105b0955ee5401a18c231dacb05577b09841623c6b51b91c652" :answer/id #uuid "6eb38827-0f8c-5f6c-a724-802ecadb3b55" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73714/selection/1af8059f5110e1943a69d3307606e517ed68a2481b41ad3c031e3e02b79e85eb" :answer/id #uuid "44e7dabb-eac3-5be4-a822-9e83ed502365" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(6x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73714/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "10ae71b0-b6c2-5526-8818-fc4f96a69613" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73714/selection/7b9970927b2dd83c5fa0f72f661c572075f63de1d1b70be88b465e9c8160fc6d" :answer-field/choices ["q-73714/selection/e45b5286f7dee8d041565f116f02c257e589352ef66d7090844001e37aaae6e4" "q-73714/selection/7b9970927b2dd83c5fa0f72f661c572075f63de1d1b70be88b465e9c8160fc6d" "q-73714/selection/d59716c54325f060c210c240d10da8050c8d98b14dad7a953b28c5f1cf292fd8" "q-73714/selection/f1da6d3489b34105b0955ee5401a18c231dacb05577b09841623c6b51b91c652" "q-73714/selection/1af8059f5110e1943a69d3307606e517ed68a2481b41ad3c031e3e02b79e85eb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73714" :question/id #uuid "2e1b8c51-6836-5b3c-99de-c30519910bed" :question/math-academy-id "q-73714" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{3}{36+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{36+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{3}{36\\cdot (1+{x}^{2}/36)}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}/36}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(x/6)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse tangent\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${(\\frac{x}{6})}^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\frac{x}{6}.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{6}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=6\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{36+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{12}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(x/6)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\cdot (6\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{1+{u}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-73714/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "227abe29-6e31-5afd-b0ca-3b8ed7d8c287"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73714"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114036/selection/c9847e4485def5777206a94b58808e0f79a327d7c972f710008d641e268f41ad" :answer/id #uuid "c556a863-a3de-5eaf-ab2f-a01319b17b55" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114036/selection/b9727d6751ec5dd4d6bb1b377350874496d39ac822772637bce30ad41c06183d" :answer/id #uuid "a0ffc6b7-799c-5756-9ee5-98d16f3ce7ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114036/selection/ffb9bd819dccdedfab6c2602e43593dd781ef3eb42d0472938e725e361878c6c" :answer/id #uuid "37101ef9-f3b0-583c-9fa6-c6717d2e4021" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114036/selection/767e7feb5e3bec2171a5894d49771983d426dfbd29e501956c283c499360a410" :answer/id #uuid "8ea6ce8d-3088-5606-a029-586b15f88b82" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114036/selection/d72be042f5e07b9b3afde6ea328302b184ce0c829c2be18d0eb64f0570eeec75" :answer/id #uuid "35ff534b-8b1d-5063-b9c6-046700feda1c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}x}{3})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114036/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7573f623-5765-5677-aacf-0c0920ac75fc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114036/selection/c9847e4485def5777206a94b58808e0f79a327d7c972f710008d641e268f41ad" :answer-field/choices ["q-114036/selection/c9847e4485def5777206a94b58808e0f79a327d7c972f710008d641e268f41ad" "q-114036/selection/b9727d6751ec5dd4d6bb1b377350874496d39ac822772637bce30ad41c06183d" "q-114036/selection/ffb9bd819dccdedfab6c2602e43593dd781ef3eb42d0472938e725e361878c6c" "q-114036/selection/767e7feb5e3bec2171a5894d49771983d426dfbd29e501956c283c499360a410" "q-114036/selection/d72be042f5e07b9b3afde6ea328302b184ce0c829c2be18d0eb64f0570eeec75"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114036" :question/id #uuid "a9e82e6e-8882-5aa2-a913-7897a2ca7947" :question/math-academy-id "q-114036" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{1}{1+3{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse tangent,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $3{x}^{2}=(\\sqrt{3}x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\sqrt{3}x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{3}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{1+3{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\sqrt{3}x)^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-114036/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "227abe29-6e31-5afd-b0ca-3b8ed7d8c287"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114036"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114054/selection/766b2a374011c3b8ad6b9dc24f6fedf2ce2b9b9807a5a4974d1caa474548d9bc" :answer/id #uuid "c4a65d66-6d08-5ebf-8b6d-75a653ddfb3c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{arcsec}(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{6}})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114054/selection/8ea9c7d779e96d362b95ce52a54f9fc3dc987c106ed882b89cef882ffa0b0b11" :answer/id #uuid "e1ad0097-91b7-56d3-b7a4-66150a0145da" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\,\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{6}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114054/selection/c94ccfdb5a205e5a35cabf434e15f9ed6f5d3e9af53761d52ea121e6200a3002" :answer/id #uuid "fc33fd18-ebfa-55be-a145-3d30fff8a245" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{6}\\,\\text{arcsec}(x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114054/selection/32b6d59b58509b75baaefa041be0973b9a6fe5300aa2e37f43b9f1bcbda9a9d6" :answer/id #uuid "b853f1ba-71c2-537d-bf14-69ca880abdca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{6}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114054/selection/5f2a2005914ec8937e07c3fd756223af4ac537b216c38cffffc008dabc1c0757" :answer/id #uuid "c72e6216-e28d-54b5-a075-74af422fe136" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{6}\\,\\text{arcsec}(x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114054/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "13788c6d-3e39-5f63-9479-17d1d8f1811f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114054/selection/32b6d59b58509b75baaefa041be0973b9a6fe5300aa2e37f43b9f1bcbda9a9d6" :answer-field/choices ["q-114054/selection/766b2a374011c3b8ad6b9dc24f6fedf2ce2b9b9807a5a4974d1caa474548d9bc" "q-114054/selection/8ea9c7d779e96d362b95ce52a54f9fc3dc987c106ed882b89cef882ffa0b0b11" "q-114054/selection/c94ccfdb5a205e5a35cabf434e15f9ed6f5d3e9af53761d52ea121e6200a3002" "q-114054/selection/32b6d59b58509b75baaefa041be0973b9a6fe5300aa2e37f43b9f1bcbda9a9d6" "q-114054/selection/5f2a2005914ec8937e07c3fd756223af4ac537b216c38cffffc008dabc1c0757"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114054" :question/id #uuid "34fc3e96-5721-5282-bac9-b580a1edad37" :question/math-academy-id "q-114054" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{6{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Note that we can rewrite this integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{|x|\\sqrt{6{x}^{2}-1}}=\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{|\\sqrt{6}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{6}x)^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\text{arcsec},$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $\\sqrt{6}x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\sqrt{6}x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{6}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{6{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{|\\sqrt{6}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{6}x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{6}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-114054/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8d18bdc7-9387-5b2d-98bd-015fa4a1eba7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114054"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73715/selection/c1abd3dc411f42f0b23e342802593e976517e1ab1f94ded84a020fc182947891" :answer/id #uuid "060d0dc4-dd76-56cb-a1d4-a7bd504be2e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(36x)}{6}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73715/selection/29bfa524e71b8295ff99b74a27ef768746053e5977c44e26decf70ed736d8025" :answer/id #uuid "defbd277-ef1e-505b-b285-7b9186d0ab3d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(6x)}{36}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73715/selection/e843302db6d6c9214079a482ec21f505bbb5a68cf74edc2202c1258e0770eeeb" :answer/id #uuid "2a00391a-1173-5adc-939e-b9d2cfc6c19e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(6x)}{6}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73715/selection/83d5a213f5d197c723190e01935844a55a6339fcf623a57553e74f279ee7031a" :answer/id #uuid "a5c18280-84aa-55da-bbed-ddb7c6554654" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{arcsec}(36x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73715/selection/025477ed20c9c527ce37bc186f4cbeb4c1133d159e51a25c557e84359876687f" :answer/id #uuid "15740c5e-8d47-509f-88bf-a5b76d5705f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(6x)}{2}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73715/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6f6d69e8-0145-519c-8f00-67004d2af730" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73715/selection/025477ed20c9c527ce37bc186f4cbeb4c1133d159e51a25c557e84359876687f" :answer-field/choices ["q-73715/selection/c1abd3dc411f42f0b23e342802593e976517e1ab1f94ded84a020fc182947891" "q-73715/selection/29bfa524e71b8295ff99b74a27ef768746053e5977c44e26decf70ed736d8025" "q-73715/selection/e843302db6d6c9214079a482ec21f505bbb5a68cf74edc2202c1258e0770eeeb" "q-73715/selection/83d5a213f5d197c723190e01935844a55a6339fcf623a57553e74f279ee7031a" "q-73715/selection/025477ed20c9c527ce37bc186f4cbeb4c1133d159e51a25c557e84359876687f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73715" :question/id #uuid "d6a84188-2fa3-529a-a3ac-082b44a3cc5c" :question/math-academy-id "q-73715" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{3\\,\\text{d}x}{|6x|\\sqrt{(6x)^{2}-1}}=$" :question/worked-solution "Note that we can rewrite this integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3\\,\\text{d}x}{|6x|\\sqrt{(6x)^{2}-1}}=3\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{|6x|\\sqrt{(6x)^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\text{arcsec},$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $6x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=6x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=6\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{6}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}3\\int \\frac{1}{|6x|\\sqrt{(6x)^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x & =3\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{6}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(6x)}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-73715/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8d18bdc7-9387-5b2d-98bd-015fa4a1eba7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73715"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-351855/field-1/a05724295bc0340162295da21b8749cd336584b7c76ed9f6810ddb03e7f98d00" :answer/id #uuid "c5d97224-db0b-5626-bc42-c9a729cbe65e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351855/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "61fa916e-ddd5-5d7e-9a54-81a3de5873cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351855/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "f84bc2aa-3f4d-5d08-8ffe-b72105efb2cc" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-351855/field-1/a05724295bc0340162295da21b8749cd336584b7c76ed9f6810ddb03e7f98d00" :answer-field/choices ["q-351855/field-1/a05724295bc0340162295da21b8749cd336584b7c76ed9f6810ddb03e7f98d00" "q-351855/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-351855" :question/id #uuid "264f6e72-6e53-5a6d-a4d9-04f39e481ab6" :question/math-academy-id "q-351855" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{12-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡($\n{{field-1}}$)$" :question/worked-solution "Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{12-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{12\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/12)}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{12}}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/12}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{12}}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/\\sqrt{12})^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{12}})}^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{12}}.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{12}}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\sqrt{12}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nBefore substituting, we use the table below to change the limits from $x$ to $u.$\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can now write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{12-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{12}}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/\\sqrt{12})^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{12}}{\\int }_{0}^{1/\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot (\\sqrt{12}\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u{|}_{0}^{1/\\sqrt{3}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}})-\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(0) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}})\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-351855/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f2f9806d-3a72-5f0a-a6f4-db8dad8871f6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-351855"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114074/selection/8d714c1fd416e58da765395a7a57c526e1b97a45c41a59520f74d433a1e9ba87" :answer/id #uuid "4cb7fd9f-06bf-573e-8840-278e82695bd4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114074/selection/e0bd991ac2e2f2a23ec920e03c6d5103be6b20c12a25d724ab290d4ba5292c3e" :answer/id #uuid "192994e5-c2a9-5cd3-84f8-cd4b092dc71c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114074/selection/7b1b8538b264eef6681d0ab5f3b14d51b6cdff67f34fba59d0886ae5c6acf80a" :answer/id #uuid "fe9e6cd5-3c33-5f3c-92d7-b484a35d21cf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114074/selection/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198" :answer/id #uuid "bac9c9c6-15d7-5235-b62f-c3a33ae2d1e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114074/selection/a996cecead059c2e05b8ded2ceb60e4e2170a4344e0c20625524ed13b23c6fbe" :answer/id #uuid "c0e65895-f4ef-5af3-857a-f7bddf126e30" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114074/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8afd6617-87da-58ab-8ac6-1f9c8a0eb642" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114074/selection/8d714c1fd416e58da765395a7a57c526e1b97a45c41a59520f74d433a1e9ba87" :answer-field/choices ["q-114074/selection/8d714c1fd416e58da765395a7a57c526e1b97a45c41a59520f74d433a1e9ba87" "q-114074/selection/e0bd991ac2e2f2a23ec920e03c6d5103be6b20c12a25d724ab290d4ba5292c3e" "q-114074/selection/7b1b8538b264eef6681d0ab5f3b14d51b6cdff67f34fba59d0886ae5c6acf80a" "q-114074/selection/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198" "q-114074/selection/a996cecead059c2e05b8ded2ceb60e4e2170a4344e0c20625524ed13b23c6fbe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114074" :question/id #uuid "9a6aaa99-e3a6-5e64-af0f-d6cc1d7bc10a" :question/math-academy-id "q-114074" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{0}^{1/8}\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Note that we can rewrite this integral as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{1/8}\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=2{\\int }_{0}^{1/8}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(4x)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $(4x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=4x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=4\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nBefore substituting, we use the table below to change the limits from $x$ to $u.$\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can now write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1/8}\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1/8}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(4x)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\cdot (\\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u{|}_{0}^{1/2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})-\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{\\pi }{6}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{12}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-114074/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f2f9806d-3a72-5f0a-a6f4-db8dad8871f6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114074"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
